{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>רעו</b> [Ro'eu]. Like תרועם בשבט ברזל (Psalms 2:9). Also חותו [note: imperative form], like סובו ציון (ibid. 48:13)." "And the meaning of <b>התאזרו</b> [be girded] is that they should do so at every moment."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "Resolved 'שם' to the same book (Psalms) cited in the preceding citation."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:47.084997899Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}